.TH QUIPU-GRAPH-WRITER-GRANT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-graph\-writer\-grant \- Apply an owner\-local scoped writer grant revision or revocation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu graph writer\-grant\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIgrant.json\fR> 
